    "description": {
      "value": "You practically live behind the controls of a vehicle and can handle just about anything the road, waves, and sky can throw at you. You likely adventure to test your skills in unusual environments and new and interesting vehicles. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Dexterity, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Acrobatics skill and the Piloting Lore skill. You gain the Assurance skill feat with Piloting Lore."
